{"availability":"available","full":"Jha-Pranav/pixelcare","name":"pixelcare","description":"AI health companion via webcam: monitors vitals, understands emotions, explains medical reports in plain  language, and has natural conversations about your wellbeing—all processed locally.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-29T02:50:19Z","updated":"2025-11-29T09:44:19Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Jha-Pranav/PixelCare","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:59.547Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:59.547Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:59.547Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:02.081Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:11:59.547Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["\"What if your laptop could be your health companion? What if checking your vitals was as simple as looking at your screen?\"","PixelCare is an AI-powered health companion that transforms your webcam into a medical-grade sensor, measuring 10 vital signs in just 10 seconds. But it's more than a health scanner—it's your personal health buddy that understands both your physical state and emotional wellbeing, analyzes your medical documents, and provides expert second opinions with transparent clinical reasoning.","✨ NEW: Upload and analyze medical documents (PDFs, X-rays, blood tests, prescriptions) with GPT-4o-mini vision!"],"features":["🩺 Virtual Examination - Measures 10 vital signs from your webcam in 10 seconds","📄 Medical Report Analysis - Upload blood tests, X-rays, prescriptions and get plain language explanations","💬 Second Opinions - Ask health questions and get expert guidance with transparent reasoning","🧠 Clinical Intelligence - See how the AI thinks through medical decisions","🔒 100% Private - All processing happens locally on your device (with Ollama)"],"